    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are now one of four crew members of a train as ancient as the universe itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Which role would you like to play?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe you see yourself as a Machinist who inspires his team to great achievements with his whip? Or are you a sturdily built Stoker wielding a heavy transformer shovel? Hmm, prefer to fight at a distance? In that case, take a look at the role of the Mechanic - this character is a master at wielding a revolver. Do you want to join the forbidden knowledge? Try on the role of the Guide: he will feed the passengers, heal the crew and turn into a chthonic creature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In any case, whatever you choose, the main thing is not that at all. The most important thing is to work. A train must perform its functions forever, and it must always have a crew.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are now one of four crew members of a train as ancient as the universe itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Which role would you like to play?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe you see yourself as a Machinist who inspires his team to great achievements with his whip? Or are you a sturdily built Stoker wielding a heavy transformer shovel? Hmm, prefer to fight at a distance? In that case, take a look at the role of the Mechanic - this character is a master at wielding a revolver. Do you want to join the forbidden knowledge? Try on the role of the Guide: he will feed the passengers, heal the crew and turn into a chthonic creature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In any case, whatever you choose, the main thing is not that at all. The most important thing is to work. A train must perform its functions forever, and it must always have a crew.</p>",
    "short_description": "By chance, you and three similarly poor people become the new crew aboard a strange train traveling through lands unknown to you. Control the train, take care of passengers, fight monsters, search for valuable items and earn money.",
    "supported_languages": "English, Russian, Japanese",
